---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Jason Kaczmarski" description="Meet Jason Kaczmarski and The Jason Kaczmarski Team, helping Middle Tennessee buyers and sellers make informed, practical decisions.">
  <section class="about-hero section">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">About Jason</span>
        <h1>Competent, candid guidance for decisions that matter.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="intro">
        <p>Jason Kaczmarski is a Middle Tennessee real estate broker with RE/MAX 1st Choice. Licensed since 2007 and a member of the RE/MAX Hall of Fame, he helps buyers and sellers understand both the numbers and the practical tradeoffs behind a move.</p>
        <p>The goal of this site is simple: give people useful answers before asking for their business.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://jasonk.remax.com/">Visit Jason's RE/MAX page <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section team-section">
    <div class="container team-intro">
      <img src="https://kvcore-library.s3.amazonaws.com/remax1stchoice8207/images/03b9616f75a8e185d56a93c799829fdf.png" width="150" height="150" alt="The Jason Kaczmarski Team logo" />
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">The team</span>
        <h2>Two agents. One practical approach.</h2>
        <p>The site is Jason's home for practical real estate guidance, backed by the team Jason and Ashlyn serve clients through together at RE/MAX 1st Choice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container profile-grid">
      <a href="https://jasonk.remax.com/"><span>Jason Kaczmarski</span><small>View Jason's RE/MAX page</small><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
      <a href="https://ashlyn-sheppard.remax.com/"><span>Ashlyn Sheppard</span><small>View Ashlyn's RE/MAX page</small><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section principles">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">How the site works</span>
      <div class="principle-grid">
        <article><span>01</span><h2>Useful first</h2><p>Calculators and guides should answer the question even if you never contact an agent.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h2>Assumptions shown</h2><p>Financial estimates should make their inputs, source dates, and limitations easy to understand.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h2>Local context</h2><p>Middle Tennessee taxes, inventory, commutes, contracts, and timing often change the generic answer.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero { min-height: 62vh; display: grid; align-items: center; background: var(--mist); }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem); align-items: center; }
  .intro p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .text-link { display: inline-flex; gap: .6rem; padding-bottom: .2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .team-section { background: white; }
  .team-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); align-items: center; max-width: 900px; }
  .team-intro img { width: 150px; height: 150px; object-fit: contain; }
  .team-intro h2 { margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  .team-intro p { max-width: 64ch; color: var(--muted); }
  .profile-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
  .profile-grid a { position: relative; display: grid; gap: .25rem; padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .profile-grid span { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .profile-grid small { color: var(--muted); }
  .profile-grid b { position: absolute; right: 1.4rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-weight: 400; }
  .principles { background: var(--navy-900); color: white; }
  .principles .eyebrow { color: #f29aa6; }
  .principle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
  article { padding: 2.2rem; background: var(--navy-900); }
  article span { color: #e5c88f; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; }
  article h2 { margin: 1.2rem 0 .8rem; font-size: 1.8rem; }
  article p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); }
  @media(max-width: 760px) { .about-grid, .team-intro, .profile-grid, .principle-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .team-intro img { width: 110px; height: 110px; } }
</style>
